flowchart TD
  accTitle: AskSales workflow overview
  accDescr: A selected business supplies resources to draft workflows. Reviewed customer actions pass delivery gates and record outcomes.
  B[Selected business and permitted resources] --> L[Lead discovery and CRM]
  B --> C[Content and proposals]
  L --> D[Campaign conversation and outreach draft]
  C --> D
  D --> R[Review exact recipients and accounts]
  R --> G{Assistant and provider ready?}
  G -->|No| H[Blocked or held for explicit review]
  G -->|Yes| P[Provider attempt]
  P --> O[Recorded outcome in activity, CRM and support]
